WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:05.890
Vin Diesel has a trilogy of sci-fi action
movies sitting in the top 10 on Netflix — one

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:08.550
of which was made over 20 years ago!

00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:13.290
But as "Riddickulous" as it may sound, there's
a simple reason for the franchise's uptick

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.274
in popularity.

00:00:14.274 --> 00:00:18.880
Despite being involved in some of the biggest
franchises of the 21st century, Vin Diesel

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:21.430
has rarely seen eye-to-eye with critics.

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:25.750
While the actor drew some acclaim for early
roles in films like The Iron Giant and Saving

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:30.810
Private Ryan, subsequent efforts such as A
Man Apart, The Pacifier, and Knockaround Guys

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:33.630
were largely dismissed as empty action vehicles.

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:38.520
Still, that hasn't slowed Diesel down one
bit, as the actor has been working steadily

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:42.000
on dozens of projects over the last 25 years.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.739
Furthermore, die-hard fans of Diesel's work
in a long-dormant science fiction franchise

00:00:46.739 --> 00:00:50.964
have seen a loose-fitting trilogy of the actor's
films returning to the limelight.

00:00:51.021 --> 00:00:56.079
As strange as it is, Richard B. Riddick has
emerged from the darkness and is currently

00:00:56.079 --> 00:00:58.860
overshadowing much of the competition on Netflix.

00:00:58.860 --> 00:01:03.940
Currently, all three films in David Twohy's
dark futuristic science fiction thriller series

00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:09.180
are sitting pretty in Netflix's top 10 list
of movies — a fact that probably has a lot

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:13.850
to do with ongoing rumors that Diesel will
be returning to the franchise to reunite with

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:15.110
Twohy yet again.

00:01:15.110 --> 00:01:19.680
The Riddick franchise launched back in 2000
with its first entry, Pitch Black.

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:23.960
The film saw a group of survivors attempting
to navigate a mysterious alien world filled

00:01:23.960 --> 00:01:27.497
with deadly nocturnal creatures after their
ship crash lands.

00:01:27.497 --> 00:01:32.010
Ironically, prisoner and serial killer Richard
B. Riddick, who possesses the unique ability

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:36.140
to see in the dark, becomes the only person
who might be able to lead the group to safety,

00:01:36.140 --> 00:01:38.664
causing the survivors to reluctantly release
him.

00:01:39.875 --> 00:01:42.664
"I am worth twice as much alive."

00:01:42.900 --> 00:01:47.250
Since the character took off in popularity
following Pitch Black, many spinoff projects

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:48.399
were put into the works.

00:01:48.399 --> 00:01:52.610
A sequel came in the form of The Chronicles
of Riddick, while an animated short film,

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:56.450
The Chronicles of Riddick: Dark Fury, filled
in the story between the two movies.

00:01:56.450 --> 00:02:01.616
Elsewhere, two well-received video games filled
in other parts of the character's mysterious backstory.

00:02:01.616 --> 00:02:05.510
The Chronicles of Riddick: Escape From Butcher
Bay showed how Riddick broke out of prison

00:02:05.510 --> 00:02:08.910
prior to being caught by a bounty hunter and
placed on the ship from Pitch Black.

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:12.890
Meanwhile, The Chronicles of Riddick: Assault
on Dark Athena sees the character trying to

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:14.940
battle his way out of a mercenary ship.

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:17.210
Finally, there was Riddick in 2013.

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:21.440
The film took the character back to basics
by having him fight for his life on a hostile

00:02:21.440 --> 00:02:24.239
planet full of deadly alien creatures.

00:02:24.239 --> 00:02:28.860
Of the three main movies, this one is currently
the highest in the Netflix top 10, with Chronicles

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:31.840
of Riddick and Pitch Black showing up in descending
order.

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:36.720
A fourth mainline "Riddick" movie was confirmed
recently, with both writer-director David

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:39.540
Twohy and franchise star Vin Diesel set to
return.

00:02:39.540 --> 00:02:45.319
Titled Riddick 4: Furya, the film will purportedly
see the character, who is the last surviving

00:02:45.319 --> 00:02:49.300
member of an alien race called the Furyans,
return to his home planet.

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:53.922
According to Twohy, the film will reveal that
Riddick is actually not the last of the Furyans.

00:02:53.922 --> 00:02:58.480
Twohy has also said that the survivors are
very much alike to Diesel's character, a factor

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:03.319
that will probably either see him team up
with them against external forces or set up

00:03:03.319 --> 00:03:07.313
a Furyan battle royale between many of the
gruff-voiced human hybrids.

00:03:07.313 --> 00:03:12.510
While more concrete details like returning
cast members or a release date are still incoming,

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:16.849
the cult following of the franchise will no
doubt be spreading the word that the property

00:03:16.849 --> 00:03:20.781
is returning — hence the sudden uptick in
interest in the series on Netflix.

00:03:20.781 --> 00:03:24.942
Whether this one can finally impress critics,
however, remains to be seen.

